    },
    {
      "zh": "正式窗口冷前缀命中为 0。新配方相对旧配方单流 Decode 高 11.34%、整窗输出吞吐高 10.24%，属于完整配方收益。",
      "en": "Measured windows had zero cold-prefix hits. The new recipe improved single-stream decode by 11.34% and aggregate output by 10.24% versus the old recipe; these are whole-recipe effects."
    }
